### Lấy danh sách posts cho một event (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts?eventId=some-event-id&page=1&limit=10

### Lấy post theo ID (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id

### Tạo post mới (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/event/some-event-id
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OTM3YTdiMzJkZDliMzc5NDdkMWQ5MjkiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRsaW5oQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsIm5hbWUiOiJUaHV5IExpbmgiLCJwaG9uZU51bWJlciI6Iis4NDkwMTIzNDU2NyIsInJvbGVJZCI6IjY5MzdhN2IzMmRkOWIzNzk0N2QxZDkyMSIsInJvbGVOYW1lIjoiYWRtaW4iLCJwZXJtaXNzaW9ucyI6WyIqIl0sImlhdCI6MTc2NTI3MTIyMiwiZXhwIjoxNzY1MjcyMTIyfQ.A7cqKiGz9vgtHNd3Y1urmbfnYjvulcklB8JYkGOlQH4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Đây là nội dung bài post",
  "images": ["https://example.com/image1.jpg"],
  "videos": ["https://example.com/video1.mp4"]
}

